    "signed_compact_i32": "Prefixes 0xxxxxxx/10xxxxxx/110xxxxx/1110xxxx consume 1/2/3/4 bytes, sign-extend 7/14/21/28 bits. Prefix >= 0xf0 consumes four further bytes as big-endian signed i32. Native writer switches to five bytes outside [-0x4000000,0x3ffffff]; reader accepts full 28-bit four-byte values."
  },
